=== SinkBathroomN2 ===

A sink laced with hairline cracks and a mineral-crusted faucet. A dried-out bar of soap sits fused to its dish.

-> SinkBathroomChoicesN2

=== SinkBathroomChoicesN2 ===

    +[Turn it on.]
        -> On
    +[Look closer.]
        -> Closer
    +[Leave]
