=== On ===

Upon turning on the sink, a light rumble can be heard from the pipes before any water is produced.

The initial stream is broken apart by <b>sputters</b> from the rusted innerworkings, but eventually a consistent flow is formed.

You turn the sink off.

-> SinkBathroomChoicesN2

=== Closer ===

Strangely, you notice what appears to be splotches of dried <b>blood.</b>

-> SinkBathroomChoicesN2
